WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:03.617
Lesson three. Wild Animals!

2
00:00:04.547 --> 00:00:12.113
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:13.103 --> 00:00:16.010
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:19.333
Today we learn: Wild Animals! Let's go!

5
00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:23.756
Lion! Say it with me. Lion!

6
00:00:27.758 --> 00:00:31.407
Elephant! Say it with me. Elephant!

7
00:00:35.421 --> 00:00:39.104
Monkey! Say it with me. Monkey!

8
00:00:43.032 --> 00:00:46.432
Zebra! Say it with me. Zebra!

9
00:00:50.656 --> 00:00:54.389
Tiger! Say it with me. Tiger!

10
00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:01.559
Giraffe! Say it with me. Giraffe!

11
00:01:05.594 --> 00:01:08.994
Bear! Say it with me. Bear!

12
00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:16.325
Snake! Say it with me. Snake!

13
00:01:20.379 --> 00:01:26.185
Listen. It has a long trunk. It is big.

14
00:01:26.235 --> 00:01:30.528
Say it with me. It has a long trunk. It is big.

15
00:01:35.502 --> 00:01:41.947
The big elephant eats green leaves in the jungle. The tall giraffe eats leaves from trees too.

16
00:01:41.997 --> 00:01:43.370
I like this story!

17
00:01:44.388 --> 00:01:49.851
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:51.051
Monkey!

19
00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:57.205
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:57.255 --> 00:01:58.405
Giraffe!

21
00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:05.062
Value corner: Politeness. Saying 'please' and 'thank you' shows we care about others.

22
00:02:05.112 --> 00:02:06.868
I can show politeness too!

23
00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:14.942
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:14.992 --> 00:02:16.566
Bye-bye, friends!

